# One-time narrator intro for the market. Same pattern as tavern_intro.dlg.

TRIGGER market
REQUIRE notFlag seenMarketIntro

NODE start
  NARRATOR: The market square opens up before you, a riot of color and noise. Stalls line every side, draped in bright awnings. Merchants call out their prices, children dart between carts, and somewhere a street musician plays an out-of-tune fiddle.
  SET flag seenMarketIntro

  # ADD journalEntry unlocks a journal entry for the player.
  ADD journalEntry market_square

  CHOICE Look around.
    END dialogue
  END
